/T (The Presidential Special Envoy's Office faces a calibration decision: whether to tighten, hold, or offer phased relief from energy sanctions, and in what sequence, to maximize U.S. leverage in active Russia-Ukraine settlement negotiations.)
/E (The Presidential Special Envoy's Office faces a calibration decision: whether to tighten, hold, or offer phased relief from energy sanctions, and in what sequence, to maximize U.S. leverage in active Russia-Ukraine settlement negotiations.)
/Pg 17 0 R
