/T (Energy sanctions warrant focused assessment because the United States exercises more direct operational control over the oil revenue pipeline than over any other major instrument in the coalition toolkit. Immobilized central bank reserves function primarily as collateral for the G7's Extraordinary Revenue Acceleration loan rather than as a calibratable negotiating tool; SWIFT reconnection falls under EU jurisdictional control; and technology export controls serve a long-horizon military modernization objective that merits retention irrespective of settlement terms.13)
/E (Energy sanctions warrant focused assessment because the United States exercises more direct operational control over the oil revenue pipeline than over any other major instrument in the coalition toolkit. Immobilized central bank reserves function primarily as collateral for the G7's Extraordinary Revenue Acceleration loan rather than as a calibratable negotiating tool; SWIFT reconnection falls under EU jurisdictional control; and technology export controls serve a long-horizon military modernization objective that merits retention irrespective of settlement terms.13)
