/T (The reactive escalation pattern matters for the Envoy's Office because it explains both the regime's demonstrated coercive capacity and its structural vulnerabilities. EU sanctions envoy David O'Sullivan characterized enforcement as "a constant game of cat and mouse."15 The enforcement gap between actual and achievable revenue denial therefore represents not a failure of ambition but a consequence of incremental implementation against an adaptive adversary.)
