/T (The EU embargo and the price cap constitute distinct but interlocking instruments. The 6th package banned EU seaborne imports of Russian crude \(effective December 5, 2022\) and petroleum products \(February 5, 2023\), a restriction on what EU members may purchase. The price cap, adopted via the 8th package \(October 2022\), applies different logic: it restricts Western maritime services globally, and permits EU operators to facilitate Russian crude shipments to third countries only if sold below the cap.21 )
/E (The EU embargo and the price cap constitute distinct but interlocking instruments. The 6th package banned EU seaborne imports of Russian crude \(effective December 5, 2022\) and petroleum products \(February 5, 2023\), a restriction on what EU members may purchase. The price cap, adopted via the 8th package \(October 2022\), applies different logic: it restricts Western maritime services globally, and permits EU operators to facilitate Russian crude shipments to third countries only if sold below the cap.21 )
