/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 615 0 R
/T (The floating cap introduced a self-reinforcing dynamic: enforcement actions push Urals prices down, the 22-week average declines, the cap adjusts downward, and the lower cap further constrains Western-serviced trade. The Bank of Finland characterized this mechanism as one that "steadily shovels sand into the gears of the Russian economy."29)
/E (The floating cap introduced a self-reinforcing dynamic: enforcement actions push Urals prices down, the 22-week average declines, the cap adjusts downward, and the lower cap further constrains Western-serviced trade. The Bank of Finland characterized this mechanism as one that "steadily shovels sand into the gears of the Russian economy."29)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
917 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 615 0 R
/T (The mechanism's effectiveness, however, faces a structural constraint from U.S.-EU divergence: the United States retained the $60 cap, which creates a bifurcated compliance environment in which a $50 transaction is compliant under U.S. rules but non-compliant under the EU's $44.10.30 The proposed full maritime services ban would resolve this through elimination of the attestation architecture; enforcement would require only verification that a vessel did not enter a Russian port. The IEA's projection of a global oil surplus in 2026 substantially mitigates the supply-disruption risk that constrained the original design.31)
/E (The mechanism's effectiveness, however, faces a structural constraint from U.S.-EU divergence: the United States retained the $60 cap, which creates a bifurcated compliance environment in which a $50 transaction is compliant under U.S. rules but non-compliant under the EU's $44.10.30 The proposed full maritime services ban would resolve this through elimination of the attestation architecture; enforcement would require only verification that a vessel did not enter a Russian port. The IEA's projection of a global oil surplus in 2026 substantially mitigates the supply-disruption risk that constrained the original design.31)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [16 18 17 19]
