/P 632 0 R
/T (Strategic hold, however, is insufficient as a negotiating strategy. CSIS warns explicitly of "diminishing returns" as Russia adapts to the existing sanctions baseline.99 The FDD's "Red Queen" framework describes an enforcement dynamic in which neither side progresses; the two-to-three-month adaptation cycle that Vakulenko and CREA data confirm means the October 2025 shock will likely dissipate by Q2 2026 without reinforcement. CREA data showed Russian seaborne crude exports surged 24 percent within two months of the January 2025 designations.100 The UK House of Commons Library documented a nine-month U.S. sanctions pause under the Trump administration through which the EU and UK continued independent escalation, a de facto transatlantic divergence.101 Most critically, Option B does not establish the enforcement credibility necessary for relief to function as an inducement: without demonstrated willingness to tighten, the offer of relief carries no coercive weight.)
/E (Strategic hold, however, is insufficient as a negotiating strategy. CSIS warns explicitly of "diminishing returns" as Russia adapts to the existing sanctions baseline.99 The FDD's "Red Queen" framework describes an enforcement dynamic in which neither side progresses; the two-to-three-month adaptation cycle that Vakulenko and CREA data confirm means the October 2025 shock will likely dissipate by Q2 2026 without reinforcement. CREA data showed Russian seaborne crude exports surged 24 percent within two months of the January 2025 designations.100 The UK House of Commons Library documented a nine-month U.S. sanctions pause under the Trump administration through which the EU and UK continued independent escalation, a de facto transatlantic divergence.101 Most critically, Option B does not establish the enforcement credibility necessary for relief to function as an inducement: without demonstrated willingness to tighten, the offer of relief carries no coercive weight.)
