/T (The third action signals selective secondary sanctions against financial intermediaries. The target set is the transaction infrastructure, not state entities, a calibration that manages diplomatic costs while it demonstrates escalation willingness. In India, UCO Bank and IndusInd Bank serve as primary intermediaries for rupee-denominated Russian oil payments. In China, the Iran template provides a proven model: OFAC designated three Shandong Province teapot refineries for Iranian crude purchases between March and May 2025, and SDN listing cut off their dollar transactions.107)
