/T (Tier 1 \(low-value, high-reversibility\) consists of vessel delistings via general license, attestation requirement relaxation, and white-list access for compliant buyers. OFAC can withdraw a general license by executive action within hours, without new legislation or coalition coordination. Tier 1 triggers on ceasefire implementation, prisoner-of-war exchanges, and initiation of a systematic child returns program; as of February 2026, only 2,003 of approximately 20,000 identified abducted Ukrainian children have returned, a figure the Atlantic Council and the Klobuchar-Grassley Act identify as central to any settlement.111)
/E (Tier 1 \(low-value, high-reversibility\) consists of vessel delistings via general license, attestation requirement relaxation, and white-list access for compliant buyers. OFAC can withdraw a general license by executive action within hours, without new legislation or coalition coordination. Tier 1 triggers on ceasefire implementation, prisoner-of-war exchanges, and initiation of a systematic child returns program; as of February 2026, only 2,003 of approximately 20,000 identified abducted Ukrainian children have returned, a figure the Atlantic Council and the Klobuchar-Grassley Act identify as central to any settlement.111)
