/T (The EU's July 2025 shift from SWIFT disconnection to a comprehensive transaction ban on 50 Russian banks complicates partial reconnection: it now requires amendment of Regulation 833/2014 by unanimous EU Council vote. Iran's SWIFT reconnection took approximately four weeks from JCPOA Implementation Day but suffered severe de-risking effects as European banks refused to process Iranian transactions for years afterward, a "JCPOA chill" precedent that any Russia timeline must address. The Envoy's Office should sequence SWIFT reconnection after energy-related relief to preserve the EU's independent leverage for the highest-value concessions. Tier 3 triggers on comprehensive settlement compliance sustained over twelve or more months.)
/E (The EU's July 2025 shift from SWIFT disconnection to a comprehensive transaction ban on 50 Russian banks complicates partial reconnection: it now requires amendment of Regulation 833/2014 by unanimous EU Council vote. Iran's SWIFT reconnection took approximately four weeks from JCPOA Implementation Day but suffered severe de-risking effects as European banks refused to process Iranian transactions for years afterward, a "JCPOA chill" precedent that any Russia timeline must address. The Envoy's Office should sequence SWIFT reconnection after energy-related relief to preserve the EU's independent leverage for the highest-value concessions. Tier 3 triggers on comprehensive settlement compliance sustained over twelve or more months.)
/Pg 46 0 R
