/P 638 0 R
/T (The strategy requires alignment of an intra-administration tension before it can function as coalition strategy. Witkoff, who functions as de facto chief interlocutor, reportedly pressed to lift energy sanctions; Rubio denied this "unequivocally"; Bessent controls the sanctions machinery through Treasury and demonstrated willingness to escalate through the October designations.117 Phase I tightening must register as coordinated strategy, not internal contradiction. Congressional engagement is essential: CAATSA's 30-day review period and the Peace Through Strength Act's provisions give Congress a formal role that strengthens the framework's credibility.)
/E (The strategy requires alignment of an intra-administration tension before it can function as coalition strategy. Witkoff, who functions as de facto chief interlocutor, reportedly pressed to lift energy sanctions; Rubio denied this "unequivocally"; Bessent controls the sanctions machinery through Treasury and demonstrated willingness to escalate through the October designations.117 Phase I tightening must register as coordinated strategy, not internal contradiction. Congressional engagement is essential: CAATSA's 30-day review period and the Peace Through Strength Act's provisions give Congress a formal role that strengthens the framework's credibility.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [16 18 17]
